    <updated>2026-10-28T05:03:57Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1622557?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>tommyjtl</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/tommyjtl</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat(providers): add Modular provider (#11645)

* feat(providers): add Modular Cloud provider

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

* fix(providers/modularcloud): measured reasoning controls and video

Address review: reasoning controls copied from the first-party host files
and kept only where this host was measured to honour them; MiniMax M3.1
Flash inherits video (verified), MiniMax M3 leaves it out (misreads clips).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

* refactor(providers): rename modularcloud to modular

Provider ID and display name are now modular / &amp;quot;Modular&amp;quot;.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

* fix(providers/modular): wire fields in the header; inherit video

Toggle and effort wire fields move to each file&amp;#39;s leading comment block.
Both MiniMax models inherit video: video_url is accepted and billed as
input on this host.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

---------

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
